<title>INDIA: India brokers going corporate to get tax exemption.</title>
<headline>India brokers going corporate to get tax exemption.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India will grant one-time permission to stock brokers to &quot;corporatise&quot; their businesses without attracting tax on capital gains, Finance Minister P. Chidambaram said on Friday.</p>
</text>
